00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:54.729
Kevin Millikin: what what we're building is a programming language. So we, the language is called compact. There's some discussion about the actual branding that we want to use and who and what the name of it will will be. So we're using compact now as kind of a placeholder for that. That's what we've been calling it.

